( gird.lux — named locals: GIRD / UNGIRD
  ./bin/nux examples/lux/gird.lux )

( One name. GIRD binds TOS; UNGIRD pops the frame. )
5 GIRD n
    n n * .
UNGIRD
10 EMIT

( Several names. The } in { a b } only ends the name list. )
3 4 { a b }
    a b + .
UNGIRD
10 EMIT

( A word: { a b -- sum } binds parameters. ; ungirds. )
@add { a b -- sum } a b + ;
3 4 add .
10 EMIT

( Nested frames. Inner UNGIRD first. )
10 20 { a b }
    3 GIRD c
        a c + .
    UNGIRD
UNGIRD
10 EMIT

( name! writes. )
5 GIRD n
    n 1 + n!
    n .
UNGIRD
10 EMIT
